                // represented as (10 * 2^0), (10 * 2^1), (10 * 2^2) ms. So, the number of samples can be calculated as follows:
                // (sample/s) * (1s/1000ms) * (10ms) * 2^(frameSizeOption)
                // = (sample/s) * (1s/100) * 2^(frameSizeOption)
